      "properties": {
        "Node name for S&R": "Note"
      },
      "widgets_values": [
        "Pertineo Collect Metadata + Save Image + Metadata\n\n1. Fill in the manual fields (purpose, references, external software, changes outside ComfyUI). Write 'none' where there is nothing to declare – empty fields show 'UNKNOWN – not provided' in the report.\n\n2. Source and license come from YOUR model_info file: copy model_info.example.json from this package to <ComfyUI user dir>/pertineo_vfx/model_info.json and add your models (key = SHA256 from the first report). Missing entries are marked UNKNOWN.\n\n3. Pertineo Production Context: declare purpose, final cut, rights and consent. It feeds the findings, the indicative triage (A–D) and the guiding principles – an orientation, not an approval.\n\n4. include_full_paths = off (default) for reports you share.\n\n5. Each run writes audit/example_001.png + .txt (+ .json / .pdf) with the same base name. Nothing is overwritten.\n\nFirst run hashes every model once (large files take a while); later runs use the cache."
      ],
      "title": "How to use"
    },
